{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash 完整参数文档 (OpenAI 兼容)",
    "description": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash 对话接口的完整 API 参考。\n\n**模型能力**：\n- 上下文长度：**1,000,000 tokens**（1M）\n- 最大输出：**524,288 tokens**（512K），推荐 **131,072 tokens**（128K），思考 token 计入其中\n- 思考模式：始终开启，通过 `reasoning_effort` 调节思考深度，默认 `max`\n- 多模态输入：支持文本、图像、视频\n- 工具调用：支持 Function Calling\n- 上下文缓存：相同前缀自动命中，命中部分体现在 `usage.prompt_tokens_details.cached_tokens`\n- 流式输出：支持 SSE 流式返回\n\n多轮对话时，请将上一轮完整 assistant message 原样放回 `messages`，包括 `reasoning_content` 和 `tool_calls`。",
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT"
    },
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://direct.evolink.ai",
      "description": "生产环境（推荐）"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://api.evolink.ai",
      "description": "备用地址"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/chat/completions": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash 对话接口（OpenAI 兼容）",
        "description": "- 使用 OpenAI Chat Completions 协议调用 MiniMax-M3.1-Flash 模型\n- **多轮对话**：支持单轮或多轮上下文对话\n- **系统提示词**：通过 `role=system` 消息自定义 AI 的角色和行为\n- **多模态输入**：`content` 支持文本 + 图像 / 视频混排\n- **思考模式**：始终开启，`reasoning_effort` 调节思考深度；思考内容通过 `reasoning_content` 返回，`content` 只包含最终回答\n- **流式输出**：支持 SSE 流式返回\n- **工具调用**：支持 Function Calling\n\n**流式响应说明**：当 `stream=true` 时，通过 Server-Sent Events 返回，每条消息格式为 `data: {JSON}`，结束时返回 `data: [DONE]`。`choices[].delta` 先增量返回 `reasoning_content`，再增量返回 `content` / `tool_calls`；设置 `stream_options.include_usage=true` 时，结束前额外返回一个包含 `usage` 的数据块。",
        "operationId": "createChatCompletionMiniMaxM31Flash",
        "tags": [
          "对话生成"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatCompletionRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "simple_text": {
                  "summary": "单轮文本对话",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Please introduce yourself."
                      }
                    ],
                    "max_completion_tokens": 131072
                  }
                },
                "multi_turn": {
                  "summary": "多轮对话（上下文理解）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "What is Python?"
                      },
                      {
                        "role": "assistant",
                        "content": "Python is a high-level programming language."
                      },
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "What are its main advantages?"
                      }
                    ],
                    "max_completion_tokens": 131072
                  }
                },
                "system_prompt": {
                  "summary": "使用系统提示词",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "system",
                        "content": "You are a Python programming assistant. Keep your answers concise."
                      },
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "How do I read a file?"
                      }
                    ],
                    "max_completion_tokens": 131072
                  }
                },
                "reasoning_effort": {
                  "summary": "调节思考深度",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "reasoning_effort": "high",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "A bat and a ball cost 1.10 in total. The bat costs 1.00 more than the ball. How much does the ball cost?"
                      }
                    ],
                    "max_completion_tokens": 131072
                  }
                },
                "image_understanding": {
                  "summary": "图像理解（多模态输入）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "What is shown in this image?"
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "image_url",
                            "image_url": {
                              "url": "https://example.com/image.jpeg",
                              "detail": "default"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ],
                    "max_completion_tokens": 131072
                  }
                },
                "video_understanding": {
                  "summary": "视频理解（多模态输入）",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Summarize this video."
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "video_url",
                            "video_url": {
                              "url": "https://example.com/video.mp4",
                              "fps": 1,
                              "detail": "default"
                            }
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ],
                    "max_completion_tokens": 131072
                  }
                },
                "tool_calling": {
                  "summary": "Function Calling 工具调用",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Check the stock for product demo-item-001."
                      }
                    ],
                    "tools": [
                      {
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                          "name": "get_product_stock",
                          "description": "Get the current stock level for a product.",
                          "parameters": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "properties": {
                              "product_id": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "description": "Product identifier."
                              }
                            },
                            "required": [
                              "product_id"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    ],
                    "max_completion_tokens": 131072
                  }
                },
                "streaming": {
                  "summary": "流式输出",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash",
                    "stream": true,
                    "stream_options": {
                      "include_usage": true
                    },
                    "messages": [
                      {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Write a short poem about spring."
                      }
                    ],
                    "max_completion_tokens": 131072
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
